WEBVTT

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.000
Hello, I'm Christian and I'm Martin.
PrevCheck is a quick health check

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.500
right in the pharmacy, because we feel that
preventive healthcare is severely neglected in Switzerland.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.000
You know that you should do a health check by the age 
of 40 at the latest, but then you still don't do it.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[tears paper]

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.500
That's why we developed PrevCheck to be quick and easy, 
measuring only what doctors actually recommend.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.200
[EviPrev Recommendations (www.eviprev.ch)]

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Uncomplicated and within half an hour,

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.500
Ideally at a pharmacy near you.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:47.000
The process is simple: Just briefly fill out the online 
questionnaire or scan the QR code in the pharmacy.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
As soon as you have filled out the questionnaire, you can come 
straight to the pharmacy for the measurements and consultation.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Once in the treatment room, it starts right away with simple 
measurements: weight, blood pressure, and a little prick in the finger.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
As soon as the measurement is done, it's a short wait.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.800
Luckily, really just a short one.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:18.000
When the report is ready, it is explained right away by the 
pharmacy staff so that you know exactly what the values mean.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.000
And that's it: 
Quick, easy, and uncomplicated.